    Bug 2048450 - Remove the ability to subscribe to an IMAP folder by clicking on a URL. r=BenC

    I'm not sure if this code is actually dead or not, but it's horrible spaghetti code, isn't tested,
    and doesn't work AFAICT.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D307464

